    "outlook": "Indian broader indices NIFTY 50 and SENSEX closed marginally positive, despite a negative market breadth indicating more declining stocks than advancing ones. Strong sector-specific action was observed, particularly in Realty and Auto, while the Nifty Bank index saw a slight decline. FIIs injected capital into the market, offsetting DII selling ahead of the open.",
